kQ7kNvwH_QVV-&_nc_oc=AdreBDDnVbJPmwn5aF2KAIFgCPm9wIMGAbJ56zO7yEMc-1zAV2S0JePwkEi9IVpUc2U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3qCppB8Fu04hIzVZx_Iu-FACDXhqna_31VwqUw6-6Wyw&oe=69F0A74C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1152286369897580", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619588_1152286373230913_5226934959439945484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gPvpGSn_MNUQ7kNvwH5MuDQ&_nc_oc=Adrn08OuipgFQYMnRVzdx1MFkeB-goBrmXISfXaU2PD51HlzteeXTw31g5eukytQNNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3E5rdKFOlB3FOfvNDnSNh-GyvXYhztVLpoHtfh_Ei2wA&oe=69F0D005"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u56fe1.png", "id": "684521228053278", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_684521231386611_6623603831782279089_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QHC9-FG-wpgQ7kNvwHQc856&_nc_oc=AdryoCXa89gIBb0v5hA3vE72Lq0rt7lINqrVR7rHtLnv6G7HyOCFA1KVs14iYX2gI88&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3JeC50dgLs2H6OYhCM4EhifvCQkeHfWUImZL0Q7ylY3Q&oe=69F0A919"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1388131016268349", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822045_1388131019601682_113874591060992121_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQoBj2-21iYQ7kNvwHJ4b8Z&_nc_oc=AdpAWEgd-h6FegEJGEhOpoZ3H6-jpJdzk0JM1SAhTkAvU7XvoxLkzONWpx484e_CmBk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af13sWiba0bdxPa54igilz4Wd7d0qG0Do1ycU0LQfrReLA&oe=69F0BEDD"}, {"file_name": "444.png", "id": "779906775198861", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_779906778532194_1744895043394346610_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LjqwxwaDi48Q7kNvwFQGjqk&_nc_oc=Adp5ezD3UNR7Xjl9EJ5fLkl8rdomFnlBkXO8iQs2HtdSDQ-y8WOsfZIJ4MtbH_MlW3k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2M0vnJtyUV9qyEd3BuQfKt0C2qJz-m0IDoHeNLiKx1lw&oe=69F09BD4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1950760892146935", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618297_1950760898813601_5680159503057088351_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bvllMQxneMQQ7kNvwEaUW6T&_nc_oc=Ado_29VaJVzS8cqlZjR5V5TdrynwgrrB9G9BqTcvlRC0MvTiHI8v2y4a4NL6M7u3qQ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2M4jr_UqALnRscmzrAI9j7xkE6JL4VZIBBrS43bkaVjg&oe=69F0B46C"}, "display_name": "Umbrella Up", "keywords": ["horror", "adventure", "simulator", "sandbox", "climb"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf83 **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2602\ufe0f\ud83d\udc80\n\n**You think your umbrellas can protect you?**\nThink again.\n\nWelcome to **Umbrella Up: Horror Mode** \u2014 where a *cute snowman* turns into a *survivor in the dark*. \ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f\n\nThe lights are out. The park\u2019s empty.\nSomething\u2019s breathing right behind you. \ud83d\udc40\nUse your umbrellas to glide, hide, and escape \u2014\nand try to survive inside this cursed amusement park.\n{1094397659433664}\nEvery shadow hides a secret.\nEvery sound could be your last warning.\nFog, flickering lights, distant laughter...\nEverything feels *off*. \ud83d\udd26\ud83d\udc7b\n\n**Just remember \u2014 don\u2019t let the lights go out.**\nWhen they do\u2026 you\u2019ll find out what\u2019s really waiting for you.\n\n## \ud83d\udc80 **Game Features**\n\n- **Haunted Theme Park Map** \u2014 thicker fog, jump scares, dynamic lighting\n- **Battery Panic System** \u2014 find batteries before your flashlight dies! \ud83d\udd0b\n- **Creepy & Funny Skins** \u2014 from *Ghost Umbrellas* to *Cursed Snowmen*\n- **Hidden Stories & Easter Eggs** \u2014 only the brave will uncover them\n\n\ud83c\udf19 **Dare to open your umbrella in the dark?**\n{1387940046384292}", "short_description": "This ain\u2019t your chill VR game anymore \u2014 it\u2019s pure chaos! \ud83d\udca5\nPop open your umbrella \ud83c\udf02 and jump into the storm! \ud83e\ude82\n\n\ud83c\udf02 One tool, endless tricks:\n\ud83e\uddd7 Climb \uff5c\ud83e\udebd Glide \uff5c\ud